# Keep the root workspace manifests/lockfile and apps/frontend source/public.
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/.cache
old-nextjs
**/.next

# Python environments and local development artifacts are not build inputs.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Runtime secrets must never enter the frontend build context or image layers.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/id_rsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
